{"name":"日期选择器","description":"日期选择器是用日历选择某一天或一段日期的表单控件 · 预订入住日期或筛选本月订单时可用日历降低格式歧义。要说明可选范围、区间是否包含当天；跨地区业务还必须说明计算日期的时区。 先知道 输入框 Input","quote":"日期别让用户手输，给个日历直接挑。","agentPrompt":"请把入住和离店做成联动的日期区间选择器：已满和不允许的日期不可选，离店必须晚于入住，并明确区间是否包含离店当天。测试跨月选择、修改入住日和无可用日期三种情况。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-date-picker\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>日期选择器<span>Date Picker</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">日期别让用户手输，给个日历直接挑。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">日期选择器是用日历选择某一天或一段日期的表单控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>预订入住日期或筛选本月订单时可用日历降低格式歧义。要说明可选范围、区间是否包含当天；跨地区业务还必须说明计算日期的时区。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>DatePicker</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"dp-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"dp-box\">2026-07-21<i class=\"dp-ico\">📅</i></div>\n    <div class=\"dp-panel\">\n      <div class=\"dp-head\"><span>‹</span><b>2026 年 7 月</b><span>›</span></div>\n      <div class=\"dp-grid dp-week\"><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span><span>日</span></div>\n      <div class=\"dp-grid\">\n        <span class=\"dp-cell dim\">29</span><span class=\"dp-cell dim\">30</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">1</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">2</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">3</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">4</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">5</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-cell\">6</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">7</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">8</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">9</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">10</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">11</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">12</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-cell\">13</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">14</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">15</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">16</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">17</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">18</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">19</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-cell\">20</span><span class=\"dp-cell on\">21</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">22</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">23</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">24</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">25</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">26</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-cell\">27</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">28</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">29</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">30</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">31</span><span class=\"dp-cell dim\">1</span><span class=\"dp-cell dim\">2</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把入住和离店做成联动的日期区间选择器：已满和不允许的日期不可选，离店必须晚于入住，并明确区间是否包含离店当天。测试跨月选择、修改入住日和无可用日期三种情况。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>选单个日期</b>：生日、截止日期、预约日</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-select\">2026-07-21<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:126px;padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);text-align:center;padding-bottom:3px\">2026 年 7 月</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;padding-bottom:2px\"><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span><span>日</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\"><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">20</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand)\">21</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">22</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">23</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">24</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">25</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">26</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>选一段时间</b>：报表区间、酒店入住离店</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:6px\"><span class=\"mk-select\">07-10</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-select\">07-17</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\"><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand)\">10</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">11</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">12</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">13</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">14</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">15</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">16</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand)\">17</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>有些日期不能选</b>：过去的日子、已约满的时段</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-select\">选个预约日<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:126px;padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\"><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;color:var(--text-3);opacity:.5;text-decoration:line-through\">19</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;color:var(--text-3);opacity:.5;text-decoration:line-through\">20</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand)\">21</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">22</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">23</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">24</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">25</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">过去的日子不可选</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>常用区间快速选择</b>：今天、最近 7 天、最近 30 天</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:6px\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">今天</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">最近 7 天</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">最近 30 天</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-select\">07-15 ~ 07-21<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>让用户手输日期文本</b>：格式五花八门，还容易写错</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">日期</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"border-color:var(--red)\">2026/7/32</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">手输的日期，格式和日子都能错</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只需<b>选择时间而不选日期</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/time-picker?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"time-picker\" aria-label=\"时间选择器 Time Picker\">时间选择器 <b>Time Picker</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-select\">14:30<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><div style=\"display:flex;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(29,33,41,.12);overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><span class=\"mk-opt \" style=\"text-align:center\">13</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\" style=\"text-align:center\">14</span><span class=\"mk-opt \" style=\"text-align:center\">15</span></div><div style=\"width:1px;background:var(--border-light)\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><span class=\"mk-opt \" style=\"text-align:center\">00</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\" style=\"text-align:center\">30</span><span class=\"mk-opt \" style=\"text-align:center\">45</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只需<b>粗粒度时间范围</b>，如“最近一个月”：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><div class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"width:126px;padding:6px 8px\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\"><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">13</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">14</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">15</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">16</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">17</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">18</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 0;border-radius:3px;\">19</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);max-width:100px\">仅需粗粒度范围时，完整日历增加操作成本</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选择<b>每周固定日期</b>，如周一、周三、周五：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"复选框 Checkbox\">复选框 <b>Checkbox</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>前端</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>后端</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>设计</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><span class=\"dp-box\">2026-07-21<i class=\"dp-ico\">📅</i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"head\"><span class=\"dp-head\" style=\"width:210px\"><span>‹</span><b>2026 年 7 月</b><span>›</span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"grid\"><span class=\"dp-grid\" style=\"width:210px\"><span class=\"dp-cell\">13</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">14</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cell\"><span class=\"dp-cell\">15</span></span><span class=\"dp-cell\">16</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">17</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">18</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">19</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">20</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sel\"><span class=\"dp-cell on\">21</span></span><span class=\"dp-cell\">22</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">23</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">24</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">25</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">26</span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"box\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">触发框</span><span class=\"pe\">Trigger</span></button><span class=\"pd\">显示已选日期，格式统一</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"head\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">月份头部</span><span class=\"pe\">Header</span></button><span class=\"pd\">切换年月的导航条</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"grid\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">日期网格</span><span class=\"pe\">Day Grid</span></button><span class=\"pd\">按每周 7 列排列，展示整月日期</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"cell\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">日期格</span><span class=\"pe\">Day Cell</span></button><span class=\"pd\">普通一天，悬停高亮</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"sel\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">选中日</span><span class=\"pe\">Selected Day</span></button><span class=\"pd\">当前选中的日期，实心高亮</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">单日期<span>Single</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dp-panel\" style=\"width:210px\"><div class=\"dp-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell\">13</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">14</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">15</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">16</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">17</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">18</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">19</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">20</span><span class=\"dp-cell on\">21</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">22</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">23</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">24</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">25</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">26</span></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">只需选择一天时，例如生日或截止日期</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">范围选择<span>Range</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dp-wrap\"><div class=\"tp-range\"><div class=\"dp-box\">07-10</div><em>→</em><div class=\"dp-box\">07-17</div></div><div class=\"dp-panel\" style=\"width:210px\"><div class=\"dp-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell on\">10</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">11</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">12</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">13</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">14</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">15</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">16</span><span class=\"dp-cell on\">17</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">要选开始和结束两天的一段区间</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">禁用日期<span>Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dp-panel\" style=\"width:210px\"><div class=\"dp-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell dis\">19</span><span class=\"dp-cell dis\">20</span><span class=\"dp-cell on\">21</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">22</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">23</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">24</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">25</span></div><div class=\"dp-foot\"><span>过去不可约</span></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">日期不可选时，提前以禁用状态说明限制</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">快捷选项<span>Shortcuts</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"dp-wrap\"><div class=\"dp-quick\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">今天</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">最近 7 天</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">最近 30 天</span></div><div class=\"dp-box\">07-15 ~ 07-21<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">高频时间范围可提供快捷选项，减少逐日选择</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">报表时间筛选</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">经营报表</b>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">最近 7 天</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-box\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px\">07-15 ~ 07-21<i class=\"dp-ico\">📅</i></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <div class=\"date-picker-sc-stat\"><div class=\"k\">销售额</div><div class=\"v\">¥ 82,410</div><div class=\"d\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">▲ 12.4%</div></div>\n        <div class=\"date-picker-sc-stat\"><div class=\"k\">订单量</div><div class=\"v\">1,286</div><div class=\"d\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">▲ 8.1%</div></div>\n        <div class=\"date-picker-sc-stat\"><div class=\"k\">客单价</div><div class=\"v\">¥ 64</div><div class=\"d\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">▼ 2.3%</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">预约日程</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;align-items:flex-start\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px\">预约线下体验</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin:3px 0 8px\">选择到店日期，灰色为已约满</div>\n        <span class=\"dp-box\" style=\"width:100%;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;padding:6px 9px\">2026-07-23<i class=\"dp-ico\">📅</i></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:6px 0;font-size:12px\">确认预约</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dp-panel\" style=\"width:190px;padding:8px 10px\">\n        <div class=\"dp-grid dp-week\"><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span><span>日</span></div>\n        <div class=\"dp-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell dis\">20</span><span class=\"dp-cell dis\">21</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">22</span><span class=\"dp-cell on\">23</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">24</span><span class=\"dp-cell dis\">25</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">26</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">设置截止日期</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">官网 2.0 上线</b><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);width:56px;flex:none\">负责人</span>\n        <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">林小hu</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);width:56px;flex:none\">截止日期</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-box\" style=\"flex:1;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;padding:6px 9px\">2026-07-31<i class=\"dp-ico\">📅</i></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">还剩 10 天，逾期会提醒负责人</div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">机票酒店预订</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"dp-box\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px\">深圳 ⇄ 杭州</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-box\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px\">入住 07-24</span>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"dp-box\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px\">离店 07-27</span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px\">查询</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dp-panel\" style=\"width:210px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px\">\n        <div class=\"dp-grid dp-week\"><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span><span>日</span></div>\n        <div class=\"dp-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell\">20</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">21</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">22</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">23</span><span class=\"dp-cell on\">24</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">25</span><span class=\"dp-cell range\">26</span></div>\n        <div class=\"dp-grid\" style=\"margin-top:2px\"><span class=\"dp-cell on\">27</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">28</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">29</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">30</span><span class=\"dp-cell\">31</span><span class=\"dp-cell dim\">1</span><span class=\"dp-cell dim\">2</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input/date\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">&lt;input type=&quot;date&quot;&gt;：日期输入控件</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/dialog-modal/examples/datepicker-dialog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">日期选择对话框示例</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/date-picker","markdown":"# 日期选择器Date Picker\n\n你可能会说\n日期别让用户手输，给个日历直接挑。\n\n**日期选择器是用日历选择某一天或一段日期的表单控件**·预订入住日期或筛选本月订单时可用日历降低格式歧义。要说明可选范围、区间是否包含当天；跨地区业务还必须说明计算日期的时区。\n先知道\n[输入框 **Input**](/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh)\n\n也常被叫作DatePicker\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请把入住和离店做成联动的日期区间选择器：已满和不允许的日期不可选，离店必须晚于入住，并明确区间是否包含离店当天。测试跨月选择、修改入住日和无可用日期三种情况。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **选单个日期**：生日、截止日期、预约日\n\n2026-07-21\n2026 年 7 月\n\n一二三四五六日\n\n20212223242526\n- **选一段时间**：报表区间、酒店入住离店\n\n07-10→07-17\n\n1011121314151617\n- **有些日期不能选**：过去的日子、已约满的时段\n\n选个预约日\n19202122232425\n过去的日子不可选\n- **常用区间快速选择**：今天、最近 7 天、最近 30 天\n\n今天最近 7 天最近 30 天\n\n07-15 ~ 07-21\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- **让用户手输日期文本**：格式五花八门，还容易写错\n\n日期2026/7/32\n手输的日期，格式和日子都能错\n- 只需**选择时间而不选日期**：使用 [时间选择器 **Time Picker**](/vibe-hub/time-picker?lang=zh)\n\n14:30\n131415\n\n003045\n- 只需**粗粒度时间范围**，如“最近一个月”：使用 [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh)\n\n13141516171819\n仅需粗粒度范围时，完整日历增加操作成本\n- 选择**每周固定日期**，如周一、周三、周五：使用 [复选框 **Checkbox**](/vibe-hub/checkbox?lang=zh)\n\n前端后端设计\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n2026-07-21📅‹**2026 年 7 月**›1314151617181920212223242526\n\n1触发框Trigger显示已选日期，格式统一\n\n2月份头部Header切换年月的导航条\n\n3日期网格Day Grid按每周 7 列排列，展示整月日期\n\n4日期格Day Cell普通一天，悬停高亮\n\n5选中日Selected Day当前选中的日期，实心高亮\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n单日期Single\n\n1314151617181920212223242526\n\n只需选择一天时，例如生日或截止日期\n\n范围选择Range\n\n07-10\n→\n07-17\n\n1011121314151617\n\n要选开始和结束两天的一段区间\n\n禁用日期Disabled\n\n19202122232425\n\n过去不可约\n\n日期不可选时，提前以禁用状态说明限制\n\n快捷选项Shortcuts\n\n今天最近 7 天最近 30 天\n\n07-15 ~ 07-21\n\n高频时间范围可提供快捷选项，减少逐日选择\n\n典型使用场景\n\n报表时间筛选\n\n**经营报表**\n        最近 7 天\n        07-15 ~ 07-21📅\n\n      \n销售额\n\n¥ 82,410\n\n▲ 12.4%\n\n        \n订单量\n\n1,286\n\n▲ 8.1%\n\n        \n客单价\n\n¥ 64\n\n▼ 2.3%\n\n预约日程\n\n**预约线下体验**\n        \n选择到店日期，灰色为已约满\n\n        2026-07-23📅\n        确认预约\n\n      \n一二三四五六日\n\n        \n20212223242526\n\n设置截止日期\n\n**官网 2.0 上线**进行中\n\n      \n负责人\n        \n        林小hu\n\n      \n截止日期\n        2026-07-31📅\n\n      \n还剩 10 天，逾期会提醒负责人\n\n机票酒店预订\n\n深圳 ⇄ 杭州\n        入住 07-24\n        →\n        离店 07-27\n        查询\n\n      \n一二三四五六日\n\n        \n20212223242526\n\n        \n272829303112\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[<input type=\"date\">：日期输入控件MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input/date)[日期选择对话框示例WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/dialog-modal/examples/datepicker-dialog/)"}